{"Title":"Order relative to authorizing the joint committee on State Administration and Regulatory Oversight to make an investigation and study of a certain current Senate document relative to sell naming rights to the Boston Convention and Exhibition Center and other properties operated by the MCCA.\r\n","BillNumber":"S3000","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J25","Name":"Joint Committee on State Administration and Regulatory Oversight","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J25","ResponseDate":"2024-12-19T14:33:26.543"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S3000/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Order","Pinslip":" December 30, 2024 -- The committee on State Administration and Regulatory Oversight, to whom was referred the petitions (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2033) of Mark C. Montigny for legislation to sell naming rights to the Boston Convention and Exhibition Center and other properties operated by the MCCA, report the accompanying Order (Senate, No. 3000).","DocumentText":"\tOrdered, That the committee on State Administration and Regulatory Oversight be authorized and directed to make an investigation and study of certain current Senate document numbered 2033 relative to selling naming rights to the Boston Convention and Exhibition Center and other properties operated by the MCCA.\r\n.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Study","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J25","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J25"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}